      "message": "Always add a symbol name for \"choices\".  This allows boards to override using this pattern:\n\n```\n# definition\nchoice TASK_HOSTCMD_THREAD_TYPE\n      \tprompt \"Host command thread selection\"\n\tdefault TASK_HOSTCMD_THREAD_SHIM if ZTEST\n\thelp\n\t   Specify how the HOSTCMD thread is allocated...\n\t   \nconfig TASK_HOSTCMD_THREAD_MAIN\t   \n        bool \"prompt\"\n        help\n           ...\nconfig TASK_HOSTCMD_THREAD_SHIM\n        bool \"prompt\"\n        help\n           ...\nendchoice\n```\n\n```\n# Board override\nconfig TASK_HOSTCMD_THREAD_TYPE\n    default TASK_HOSTCMD_THREAD_SHIM\n```",
